## Model card

- **Name:** Kimi K2.8 Preview (Moonshot AI)
- **Short description:** Moonshot AI's coding model in the Kimi Code line, released 2026-09-11; performance close to Kimi K3 with more efficient thinking; 1M-token context on every membership tier; text+image+video in → text out; reasoning yes (low/high/max effort levels, default max); tool calling yes; proprietary; available via Kimi Code (kimi-for-coding model ID), not open weights or pay-per-token API.
- **Provider / access:** Moonshot AI (Kimi Code, kimi-for-coding); API via moonshot.ai.
- **Release / knowledge:** Released 2026-09-11; knowledge cutoff not stated.
- **IDs:** `moonshotai/kimi-k2.8-preview` (opencode.ai), `kimi-k2.8-preview` (model-queue slug).
- **Context window:** 1,000,000 tokens (opencode.ai; nextaimodel.com; kimi.com docs). Verified.
- **Modalities:** Text + image + video in, text out (multimodal); reasoning yes; tool calls yes; structured output not explicitly advertised.
- **Pricing (as of 2026-10-16):** Not publicly listed as pay-per-token (Kimi Code subscription model); opencode.ai lists input/output as unavailable.
- **Architecture:** Undisclosed (parameter count, MoE/dense not published for K2.8 Preview).

### Raw benchmarks found

**No public benchmark scores found.** opencode.ai shows usage stats but no benchmarks. benchmarklist.com shows 0 score rows ("0 benchmarks"). The Kimi-K2 technical report (older generation, 2025-07-13) shows MMLU 78.6, HumanEval Pass@1 73.2% for Kimi-K2 — not K2.8 Preview. Kimi K2.7 Code (June 2026) showed +10.4% on Program-Bench, +11.4% on MCP Mark Verified, +76.2% on SWE Marathon vs K2.6 — not K2.8.

### Conflicting results noted

- None — there are no benchmark results at all for Kimi K2.8 Preview. Kimi's own claims ("performance close to K3," "more efficient thinking") are marketing, not measured results.

### Normalized scores (1–100)

**No evidence base exists for scoring.** All quality dimensions and Overall are marked insufficient evidence; no numeric scores are assigned. Cost efficiency is not scored regardless.

- **Tool use: insufficient evidence.** No public agent/tool benchmarks.
- **Reasoning: insufficient evidence.** No public reasoning benchmarks.
- **Context window: 85/100.** Declared 1M tokens (spec sheet); no public retrieval score.
- **Multimodal: insufficient evidence.** Text+image+video in claimed; no vision benchmark scores.
- **Coding: insufficient evidence.** No public coding benchmarks.
- **Cost efficiency: not scored** (per formula).
- **Overall Score: not computed — insufficient evidence.** No dimensional scores available to average.

